{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"rock_tin","model_identifier":"rock_tin","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# rock_tin\n\nTin node: dark rock with pale glints.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -43..35, y 0..39, z -34..30 units (2.19 x 1.10 x 1.80 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 64 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 25.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 78 x 39 x 64 (w x h x d), centred at x -4, z -2\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `full` (visible by default): untouched node\n- `depleted`: mined out: smaller broken chunks and gravel\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `hit` | 0.3 | once | short shake when struck (both sets) |\n"},"resolution":{"width":64,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"rock0","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-28.0,0.0,-22.0],"to":[28.0,32.0,22.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,44.0,56.0,76.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,76.0,44.0,108.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,44.0,56.0,76.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[0.0,76.0,44.0,108.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,56.0,44.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[0.0,0.0,56.0,44.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d4aecec4-be4b-56b2-b23d-69f5f4cf5803"},{"name":"rock0_cap","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-17.92,32.0,-13.2],"to":[16.8,39.04,14.08],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.08,229.96,34.8,237.0],"textur